DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/data-security/posture/policies/{policy_id}
Deletes a policy configuration.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID for the user making the request.; policy_id (path) — A UUID identifying the policy.

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/data-security/posture/webhooks/{webhook_id}
Soft deletes a webhook configuration by its unique identifier. The webhook will be marked as deleted and will no longer be available for use.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID for the user making the request.; webhook_id (path) — A UUID identifying the webhook configuration.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/data-security/posture/exports/{id}
Retrieves a single export job by its unique identifier
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID for the user making the request.; id (path) — Unique identifier for the export job

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/data-security/posture/findings/{finding_id}
Gets a security Finding that has been identified as being problematic.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID for the user making the request.; finding_id (path) — A base64-encoded ID identifying this Finding.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/data-security/posture/findings/{finding_id}/instances/{instance_id}
Gets a security Finding instance by id.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID for the user making the request.; finding_id (path) — A base64-encoded ID identifying this Finding.; instance_id (path) — A uuid ID identifying this Finding instance.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/data-security/posture/finding_types/{finding_type_id}
Retrieve a specific finding type by its unique identifier.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID for the user making the request.; finding_type_id (path) — A UUID string identifying the finding type.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/data-security/posture/policies/{policy_id}
Retrieves the details of a specific policy configuration, including its associated remediation and webhook actions.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID for the user making the request.; policy_id (path) — The UUID of the policy configuration to retrieve.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/data-security/posture/webhooks/{webhook_id}
Retrieves a specific webhook configuration by its unique identifier.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID for the user making the request.; webhook_id (path) — A UUID identifying the webhook configuration.

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/data-security/posture/policies/{policy_id}
Updates an existing policy configuration and replaces its actions.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID for the user making the request.; policy_id (path) — Policy configuration ID; body (body)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/data-security/posture/webhooks/{webhook_id}
Updates an existing webhook configuration with new settings.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID for the user making the request.; webhook_id (path) — A UUID identifying the webhook configuration.; body (body)
